B-pass2/agent-skills:\ntotal 100\ndrwxrwxr-x  9 vince vince  4096 Nov  5 12:57 .\ndrwxrwxr-x  7 vince vince  4096 Nov  5 12:57 ..\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 vince vince  4096 Nov  5 12:57 .claude-plugin\ndrwxrwxr-x  8 vince vince  4096 Nov  5 12:57 .git\ndrwxrwxr-x  3 vince vince  4096 Nov  5 12:57 .gitcode\n-rw-rw-r--  1 vince vince    39 Nov  5 12:57 .gitignore\n-rw-rw-r--  1 vince vince   124 Nov  5 12:57 .gitmodules\n-rw-rw-r--  1 vince vince 12451 Nov  5 12:57 LICENSE\n-rw-rw-r--  1 vince vince 39106 Nov  5 12:57 README.md\ndrwxrwxr-x  7 vince vince  4096 Nov  5 12:57 community\ndrwxrwxr-x  6 vince vince  4096 Nov  5 12:57 docs\ndrwxrwxr-x 14 vince vince  4096 Nov  5 12:57 official\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 vince vince  4096 Nov  5 12:57 tests\n\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B-pass2/home:\ntotal 24\ndrwxrwxr-x 5 vince vince 4096 Nov  5 12:58 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 7 vince vince 4096 Nov  5 12:57 ..\ndrwxrwxr-x 7 vince vince 4096 Nov  5 12:58 .atlas\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 vince vince 1280 Nov  5 12:58 .atlas.json\ndrwxrwxr-x 3 vince vince 4096 Nov  5 12:58 .cache\ndrwxrwxr-x 4 vince vince 4096 Nov  5 12:58 .npm\n/home/vince/projects/AtlasCode/.claude/worktrees/gate088-base/dist/cli.js\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f884ac0fca1d3be","type":"function","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"ls /home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B-pass2/ws -la; find /home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B-pass2/ws -type f 2>/dev/null | head\",\"description\":\"Check working directory ws contents\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f884ac0fca1d3be","content":"[exit code: 0]\ntotal 8\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 vince vince 4096 Nov  5 12:57 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 7 vince vince 4096 Nov  5 12:57 ..\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a27842061d09a21","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.atlas/plugins/marketplaces/atlas-plugins/plugins/ascend-perf-optimize/skills/ascend-perf-optimize/references/bottleneck-location.md\"}"}},{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9122633cfdc7d39e","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.atlas/plugins/marketplaces/atlas-plugins/plugins/ascend-perf-optimize/skills/ascend-perf-optimize/references/perf-tiling-recorrection.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a27842061d09a21","content":"1\t---\n2\ttier: T1\n3\tconfidence: verified\n4\tsource-of-truth:\n5\t  repo: cannbot-skills\n6\t  sha: c24e8b5bc53e190504d8b09359fe5d5fa4ef3a4c\n7\t  path: ops/ops-profiling/references/optimization_quickref.md\n8\t  cann_version: 8.0.RC3\n9\t  verified_date: 2026-09-20\n10\tsource-of-text:\n11\t  origin: cannbot\n12\t  ref: https://gitcode.com/cann/cannbot-skills@c24e8b5\n13\t  note: \"从 cannbot ops-profiling optimization_quickref.md 抽取 10 类 bound 判定阈值、定向优化方法、交叉关联诊断与 4 案例自撰重写；CANN OSL v2.0 non-sublicensable field-limited 华为 AI 处理器，引用+溯源不 vendor 文本\"\n14\tlicense: CANN-OSL-2.0\n15\t---\n16\t\n17\t# 瓶颈定位与定向优化（10 类 bound）\n18\t\n19\t> msprof 采数后按 Main Bound 判定（见 `msprof-collection.md` §三）定位瓶颈执行单元，本文给出**每类 bound 的判定阈值 + 定向优化方法 + 交叉关联诊断 + 实战案例**。判定字段来自 op_summary_*.csv 的 PipeUtilization / ResourceConflictRatio / L2Cache 组。\n20\t\n21\t## 1. VEC Bound\n22\t\n23\t| 判定 | 优化方法 |\n24\t|---|---|\n25\t| `aiv_vec_ratio` > 50% 占比最大 | UB 融合（多 elementwise 合一）/ 减少 Cast（类型转换合并）/ 融合指令（Fusion 优化）/ 低延迟归约 / AIC:AIV = 1:2（Cube:Vector 核比）/ Counter 模式（统计类用 counter 寄存器） |\n26\t\n27\t> VEC bound = 向量计算是瓶颈。减少向量指令数（融合/去 Cast）或加 Vector 核（AIC:AIV 调比）。\n28\t\n29\t## 2. MTE2 Bound\n30\t\n31\t| 判定 | 优化方法 |\n32\t|---|---|\n33\t| `ai*_mte2_ratio` 最高（> 80% 或占比最大 > 70%） | 增大单次搬运量（大 tile）/ 512B 对齐（地址对齐提带宽）/ L2 CacheMode（缓存命中）/ 避免同地址重复搬 / DoubleBuffer（搬入与计算重叠）/ 增大 Tile（减搬运次数） |\n34\t\n35\t> MTE2 = 搬入（DDR→UB）瓶颈。核心是**提带宽**（对齐 + 大块 + 缓存）和**重叠**（DoubleBuffer 让搬运与计算并行）。\n36\t\n37\t## 3. CUBE Bound\n38\t\n39\t| 判定 | 优化方法 |\n40\t|---|---|\n41\t| `aic_cube_ratio` 占比最大 | L0C 累加（中间结果驻 L0C 不落 L1）/ L1 复用（输入驻 L1 多次用）/ BT Buffer / FP Buffer / AtomicAdd（累加用原子加免中转） |\n42\t\n43\t> CUBE = 矩阵乘瓶颈。优化 L0/L1 缓存复用，减少中间结果往返。\n44\t\n45\t## 4. SCALAR Bound\n46\t\n47\t| 判定 | 优化方法 |\n48\t|---|---|\n49\t| `ai*_scalar_ratio` > 30% | 缩小 TilingData（减标量循环）/ 减少核数（标量串行部分核多无用）/ TPipe 外置 / 移出不变量（常量提到循环外） |\n50\t\n51\t> SCALAR = 标量处理瓶颈（地址计算/循环控制）。减标量工作量或把不变量提出循环。Atlas A2 单 head 约 20-21us。\n52\t\n53\t## 5. 核间负载不均衡\n54\t\n55\t| 判定 | 优化方法 |\n56\t|---|---|\n57\t| PipeUtilization 各核 `ai*_time`（cycle）差异 > 10% | 均匀分配尾块 / 调整 blockDim（核数）/ 动态负载均衡 |\n58\t\n59\t> 逐核 cycle 差异大 = 尾核拖慢整体。均匀分尾块或减核数让每核满载。逐核 cycle 须 sample aicore.db（见 `msprof-collection.md` §1.3）。\n60\t\n61\t## 6. Bank Conflict\n62\t\n63\t| 判定 | 优化方法 |\n64\t|---|---|\n65\t| ResourceConflictRatio `aiv_vec_total_cflt_ratio` > 5% | bankgroup 冲突 / bank 冲突 / 资源冲突 / MTE 冲突四类——按冲突类型调整访问模式 |\n66\t\n67\t> UB 有 48 banks / 16 groups，每 bank 32B。连续访问同 bank 会串行化。调整访问步长让访问落不同 bank。\n68\t\n69\t## 7. DoubleBuffer 未生效\n70\t\n71\t| 判定 | 优化方法 |\n72\t|---|---|\n73\t| MTE2 和 VEC 串行（无重叠），bufNum = 1 | InitBuffer `bufNum = 2` / EnQue-DeQue 严格配对 / 避免 Sync 同步阻塞 |\n74\t\n75\t> DoubleBuffer = 搬入与计算重叠。bufNum=2 时双缓冲，搬运 A 时算 B。重叠 > 30% 才算生效。配对错（EnQue 无 DeQue）会退化成单缓冲。\n76\t\n77\t## 8. 流水线气泡\n78\t\n79\t| 判定 | 优化方法 |\n80\t|---|---|\n81\t| 多单元 30-50% 无明显主导（无 bound） | 增 workspace 份数 / DoubleBuffer / 异步迭代 / 调 AIC:AIV 比例 |\n82\t\n83\t> 无单点 bound 但整体利用低 = 流水气泡（stage 间等待）。增缓冲份数让各 stage 都有数据可处理。\n84\t\n85\t## 9. L2 Cache 命中率低\n86\t\n87\t| 判定 | 优化方法 |\n88\t|---|---|\n89\t| L2Cache `hit_rate` < 50% | SetL2CacheHint（显式缓存提示）/ 禁用不需要缓存的数据 / L2 切分 / 小矩阵驻 L1 |\n90\t\n91\t> L2 miss 多 = 反复从 DDR 取。提示热点数据缓存，冷数据不缓存（避免挤占）。\n92\t\n93\t## 10. 交叉关联诊断\n94\t\n95\t多指标关联时，先解根因再解表象：\n96\t\n97\t| 关联 | 先解 | 依据 |\n98\t|---|---|---|\n99\t| 高 vec_ratio + 高 bank_cflt | 先解 bank conflict | bank 串行化拉高 vec 占比假象 |\n100\t| 高 mte2 + 低 L2 hit | 先设 CacheMode | L2 miss 致反复搬入拉高 mte2 |\n101\t| 高 fixpipe | 512B 对齐 | fixpipe 对地址对齐敏感 |\n102\t| 高 mte2 + 高 mte3 | 联合看 | 带宽共享，互相拉高 |\n103\t\n104\t## 实战案例\n105\t\n106\t### 案例 1：GroupedMatmul（AIC:AIV 比例，41% 提升）\n107\t\n108\t瓶颈：Cube 计算重、Vector 闲。优化：调 AIC:AIV 核比（加 Cube 核减 Vector 核）+ workspace 份数 + DoubleBuffer。收益 41%。\n109\t\n110\t### 案例 2：Matmul Tiling（BlockDim 不足，4.75x）\n111\t\n112\t瓶颈：blockDim 太少，核间负载不均且单核 tile 过大。优化：增 blockDim + 调 tile 大小（L1 复用）。收益 4.75x（低垂果实——核数不足是首要瓶颈）。\n113\t\n114\t### 案例 3：FlashAttention（地址对齐，fixpipe 80%→55%）\n115\t\n116\t瓶颈：fixpipe 占比 80%（地址未对齐）。优化：512B 地址对齐。fixpipe 降至 55%。\n117\t\n118\t### 案例 4：MC² 通算融合（32.7%）\n119\t\n120\t瓶颈：通信与计算串行。优化：MC² 通算融合（通信与计算重叠）。收益 32.7%。\n121\t\n122\t## 关联\n123\t\n124\t- `msprof-collection.md` — msprof 采集 + 7 组指标 + Main Bound 判定优先级\n125\t- `perf-pipeline-methodology.md` — 三层管线流程（本文是 Step 4 核内 bound 层）\n126\t- `perf-tiling-recorrection.md` — bound 定位后回溯 tiling 修正\n127\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9122633cfdc7d39e","content":"1\t---\n2\ttier: T1\n3\tconfidence: verified\n4\tsource-of-truth:\n5\t  repo: cannbot-skills\n6\t  sha: c24e8b5bc53e190504d8b09359fe5d5fa4ef3a4c\n7\t  path: ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/SKILL.md\n8\t  cann_version: 8.0.RC3\n9\t  verified_date: 2026-09-20\n10\tsource-of-text:\n11\t  origin: cannbot\n12\t  ref: https://gitcode.com/cann/cannbot-skills@c24e8b5\n13\t  note: \"从 cannbot ascendc-perf-optimize SKILL.md 四步流程中每步的 tiling 修正建议抽取自撰重写，桥接性能瓶颈→tiling 重设计；CANN OSL v2.0 non-sublicensable field-limited 华为 AI 处理器，引用+溯源不 vendor 文本\"\n14\tlicense: CANN-OSL-2.0\n15\t---\n16\t\n17\t# 性能驱动的 tiling 修正（回溯 ascend-tiling-design）\n18\t\n19\t> 性能优化的每步（卡间/核间/核内）定位瓶颈后，产出**tiling 修正建议**回溯 `ascend-tiling-design` skill 的 Step 1 理论建模。本文是**瓶颈→tiling 参数**的映射表：据 `bottleneck-location.md` 定的 bound 类型，改哪个 tiling 参数。\n20\t\n21\t## 一、修正闭环\n22\t\n23\t```\n24\tascend-tiling-design Step 1：初始 tiling plan（blockDim / tile 大小 / Buffer 份数 / 对齐）\n25\t  ↓ 跑一版 + msprof 采数\n26\tbottleneck-location.md：定 bound 类型\n27\t  ↓ 本文：bound → tiling 参数修正\n28\t回改 tiling plan（重建模）\n29\t  ↓ AscendBenchmarkRunner 量化前后吞吐\n30\t```\n31\t\n32\t> tiling 修正是**回溯**，不是新设计——基于 ascend-tiling-design 的四要素（多核切分 / UB tiling / Buffer 规划 / 分支覆盖）改参数。\n33\t\n34\t## 二、bound → tiling 参数映射\n35\t\n36\t| bound 类型 | 改的 tiling 参数 | 方向 |\n37\t|---|---|---|\n38\t| MTE2 Bound | tile 大小 / DoubleBuffer 份数 / 512B 对齐 | 增大 tile（减搬运次数）/ bufNum=2（搬算重叠）/ 地址对齐 |\n39\t| CUBE Bound | L0C/L1 复用策略 / tile 大小 | 中间结果驻 L0C / 输入驻 L1 / 调 tile 让 L1 装下 |\n40\t| VEC Bound | AIC:AIV 核比 / 融合策略 | 加 Vector 核 / elementwise 融合减指令 |\n41\t| SCALAR Bound | TilingData 大小 / 核数 / 不变量位置 | 缩 TilingData / 减核 / 不变量提出循环 |\n42\t| 核间不均衡 | blockDim / 尾块分配 | 增减核数 / 均匀分尾块 |\n43\t| Bank Conflict | 访问步长 / tile 形状 | 调步长让访问落不同 bank |\n44\t| DoubleBuffer 未生效 | bufNum / EnQue-DeQue 配对 | bufNum=2 / 修配对 |\n45\t| 流水气泡 | workspace 份数 / AIC:AIV | 增缓冲份数 / 调核比 |\n46\t| L2 Cache 低 | SetL2CacheHint / tile 大小 | 提示缓存 / 小矩阵驻 L1 |\n47\t\n48\t## 三、分层修正（与三层管线对应）\n49\t\n50\t### 卡间层（Step 2）\n51\t\n52\t- 瓶颈：通信裸露（未与计算重叠）。\n53\t- 修正：卡间切分粒度（按 batch/seq 切的大小）、通信合并策略。\n54\t- 回溯：ascend-tiling-design 卡间切分。\n55\t\n56\t### 核间层（Step 3）\n57\t\n58\t- 瓶颈：各核 cycle 差异 > 10%。\n59\t- 修正：blockDim（核数）、尾块分配算法。\n60\t- 回溯：ascend-tiling-design 多核切分。\n61\t\n62\t### 核内层（Step 4）\n63\t\n64\t- 瓶颈：某执行单元 bound（见 `bottleneck-location.md`）。\n65\t- 修正：tile 大小、DoubleBuffer 份数、对齐、L0C/L1 复用、AIC:AIV 比例。\n66\t- 回溯：ascend-tiling-design 单核切分 + Buffer 规划。\n67\t\n68\t## 四、修正后验证\n69\t\n70\t每轮 tiling 修正后**必须**：\n71\t\n72\t1. **AscendCodeGen 重生成**（若 kernel 结构变）或 **Read/Edit** 改 tiling 参数（若仅参数变）。\n73\t2. **AscendCompilerBridge** 重编译（`python3 setup.py build_ext`）。\n74\t3. **AscendGoldenTest** 确认正确性未回归（优化不能破坏正确性——这是硬门）。\n75\t4. **AscendBenchmarkRunner** 量化前后吞吐对比（before/after throughput）。\n76\t\n77\t> 优化破坏正确性是常见坑：增 tile 可能溢出 UB、调对齐可能改变语义。**每轮先跑 GoldenTest 再看性能**。\n78\t\n79\t## 五、何时停止迭代\n80\t\n81\t- 目标吞吐达成 → 停。\n82\t- 连续 2 轮无提升（< 5%）→ 边际收益递减，停。\n83\t- 单层 bound 解了但整体无提升 → 上溯一层（核内解了看核间，核间解了看卡间）。\n84\t\n85\t## 关联\n86\t\n87\t- `bottleneck-location.md` — bound 判定（本文修正的输入）\n88\t- `msprof-collection.md` — 采数（本文修正的依据来源）\n89\t- `perf-pipeline-methodology.md` — 三层管线流程（本文是每步的修正环节）\n90\t- `ascend-tiling-design` skill — Step 1 理论建模（本文回溯的目标）\n91\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b86e3987307d59b5","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/work/gemm_op/csrc/GEMM_custom.asc\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b86e3987307d59b5","content":"1\t// GEMM 算子 — Ascend C 自定义算子（Vector 单元实现）\n2\t// Scaffold generated by AscendCBackend (structurally derived from op-examples/GELU).\n3\t// Compute body is a PLACEHOLDER — fill via the coding base (Read/Edit/Write).\n4\t//\n5\t// 公式: TODO — document the operator formula here\n6\t//\n7\t// 模板证据: op-examples/csrc/gelu_custom.asc\n8\t//   ascend-official/op-plugin/examples/cpp_extension/csrc/add_custom.asc\n9\t#include <torch/extension.h>\n10\t#include \"torch_npu/csrc/core/npu/NPUStream.h\"\n11\t#include \"torch_npu/csrc/framework/OpCommand.h\"\n12\t#include \"kernel_operator.h\"\n13\t\n14\tconstexpr uint32_t BUFFER_NUM = 2;  // 双缓冲\n15\t\n16\t// ------------------------------ KernelGEMM 算子类 ------------------------------\n17\tclass KernelGEMM {\n18\tpublic:\n19\t    __aicore__ inline KernelGEMM() {}\n20\t\n21\t    // 初始化：全局内存映射 + 缓冲队列\n22\t    __aicore__ inline void Init(GM_ADDR x, GM_ADDR z, uint32_t totalLength)\n23\t    {\n24\t        this->blockLength = totalLength / AscendC::GetBlockNum();\n25\t        if (this->blockLength == 0) return;\n26\t        this->tileNum = 8;\n27\t        this->tileLength = this->blockLength / this->tileNum / BUFFER_NUM;\n28\t        this->xGm.SetGlobalBuffer((__gm__ half *)x + this->blockLength * AscendC::GetBlockIdx(),\n29\t                                  this->blockLength);\n30\t        this->zGm.SetGlobalBuffer((__gm__ half *)z + this->blockLength * AscendC::GetBlockIdx(),\n31\t                                  this->blockLength);\n32\t        this->pipe.InitBuffer(this->inQueueX, BUFFER_NUM, this->tileLength * sizeof(half));\n33\t        this->pipe.InitBuffer(this->outQueueZ, BUFFER_NUM, this->tileLength * sizeof(half));\n34\t    }\n35\t\n36\t    __aicore__ inline void Process()\n37\t    {\n38\t        this->tileNum = 8;\n39\t        for (int32_t i = 0; i < this->tileNum; i++) {\n40\t            this->CopyIn(i);\n41\t            this->Compute(i);\n42\t            this->CopyOut(i);\n43\t        }\n44\t    }\n45\t\n46\tprivate:\n47\t    __aicore__ inline void CopyIn(int32_t progress)\n48\t    {\n49\t        AscendC::LocalTensor<half> xLocal = this->inQueueX.AllocTensor<half>();\n50\t        AscendC::DataCopy(xLocal, this->xGm[progress * this->tileLength], this->tileLength);\n51\t        this->inQueueX.EnQue(xLocal);\n52\t    }\n53\t\n54\t    __aicore__ inline void Compute(int32_t progress)\n55\t    {\n56\t        AscendC::LocalTensor<half> xLocal = this->inQueueX.DeQue<half>();\n57\t        AscendC::LocalTensor<half> zLocal = this->outQueueZ.AllocTensor<half>();\n58\t        // PLACEHOLDER — op-specific compute (see gelu_custom.asc: Mul→Erf→Mul→Add→Mul)\n59\t        AscendC::DataCopy(zLocal, xLocal, this->tileLength);\n60\t        this->outQueueZ.EnQue<half>(zLocal);\n61\t        this->inQueueX.FreeTensor(xLocal);\n62\t    }\n63\t\n64\t    __aicore__ inline void CopyOut(int32_t progress)\n65\t    {\n66\t        AscendC::LocalTensor<half> zLocal = this->outQueueZ.DeQue<half>();\n67\t        AscendC::DataCopy(this->zGm[progress * this->tileLength], zLocal, this->tileLength);\n68\t        this->outQueueZ.FreeTensor(zLocal);\n69\t    }\n70\t\n71\tprivate:\n72\t    AscendC::TPipe pipe;\n73\t    AscendC::TQue<AscendC::TPosition::VECIN, BUFFER_NUM> inQueueX;\n74\t    AscendC::TQue<AscendC::TPosition::VECOUT, BUFFER_NUM> outQueueZ;\n75\t    AscendC::GlobalTensor<half> xGm;\n76\t    AscendC::GlobalTensor<half> zGm;\n77\t    uint32_t blockLength = 0;\n78\t    uint32_t tileNum = 0;\n79\t    uint32_t tileLength = 0;\n80\t};\n81\t\n82\t// ------------------------------ host launcher (方式3) ------------------------------\n83\t// 方式3（推荐）: stream(false) + OpCommand::RunOpApiV2\n84\tnamespace ascendc_ops {\n85\tat::Tensor GEMM_custom(const at::Tensor &x)\n86\t{\n87\t    auto z = at::empty_like(x);\n88\t    uint32_t totalLength = 1;\n89\t    for (auto i = 0; i < x.dim(); i++) { totalLength *= x.size(i); }\n90\t    auto acl_stream = c10_npu::getCurrentNPUStream().stream(false);\n91\t    uint32_t blockDim = 8;\n92\t    GEMM_custom<<<blockDim, nullptr, acl_stream>>>(\n93\t        reinterpret_cast<__gm__ uint8_t *>(x.storage().data_ptr().get()),\n94\t        reinterpret_cast<__gm__ uint8_t *>(z.storage().data_ptr().get()),\n95\t        totalLength);\n96\t    at_npu::native::OpCommand::RunOpApiV2(\"ascendc_GEMM\", [&]() {});\n97\t    return z;\n98\t}\n99\t}  // namespace ascendc_ops\n100\t\n101\t// ------------------------------ kernel entry ------------------------------\n102\textern \"C\" __global__ __vector__ void GEMM_custom(GM_ADDR x, GM_ADDR z, uint32_t totalLength)\n103\t{\n104\t    KernelGEMM op;\n105\t    op.Init(x, z, totalLength);\n106\t    op.Process();\n107\t}\n108\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer quest